@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11
|Sales Employee|
start
:Open customer overview;
|System|
:Show central customer and address information;
|Sales Employee|
if (Add customer?) then ([yes])
  :Enter company, contact, delivery and invoice address;
  if (Acquisition offer explicitly agreed?) then ([yes])
    :Record agreed first-order incentive;
  else ([no])
  endif
else ([no])
  :Select customer and edit data;
endif
|System|
:Validate supplied information;
if (Data valid?) then ([yes])
  :Save central customer and address data;
  :Show confirmation;
else ([no])
  :Show validation error without changes;
endif
stop
@enduml
